B.Zt=new A.a3("6. In-app purchases (Microsoft Store)","Subscriptions, when applicable, are processed by the Microsoft Store (Microsoft Corporation). Payments and subscription management are handled through the user's Microsoft account. Perfect Gest Dev does not process or store card data.")
